   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Meet the Story 📖",
   "text": "'Meera planted a seed. She gave it water every day. Soon a little green plant came up.' — a tiny story!",
   "emoji": "📖",
   "bgColor": "from-green-400 to-emerald-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Who is in it? 👧",
   "text": "The who is Meera — the character. The what is a seed that grew. The where is her garden!",
   "emoji": "👧",
   "bgColor": "from-orange-400 to-amber-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "What Happened First? ⏳",
